:name: HWA10
:description: ScanWatch 2 (nRF52840 + S140 7.3.0) firmware bring-up

using sysbus

mach create "hwa10"
machine LoadPlatformDescription @hwa10.repl
sysbus ApplySVD @NRF52840.svd

# whole internal flash image: MBR+SD @0, appl @0x27000, bl @0xfc000.
# `set image @out/flash-relinked.bin` before the include runs another image
# through the same rig; `?=` leaves an already-set value alone.
$image?=@flash.bin
sysbus LoadBinary $image 0x0
# external SPI-NOR content (untracked dump; see README) served by spi2's flash model
sysbus.spi2 LoadImage @external_flash.bin

# capture wlog UART to file. Renode resolves an output path against the
# directory of the script that names it, not the working directory, so the
# rig's out/ is reached from scripts/ rather than named outright.
sysbus.uart0 CreateFileBackend $ORIGIN/../out/uart0.log true
sysbus.uart1 CreateFileBackend $ORIGIN/../out/uart1.log true

# Erased UICR: NRFFW[0] is the MBR's bootloader start address and NRFFW[1] its
# parameter page, and an erased word is what tells the MBR to forward to the
# SoftDevice instead. The update run overwrites NRFFW[0] to take the other path.
sysbus WriteDoubleWord 0x10001014 0xFFFFFFFF
sysbus WriteDoubleWord 0x10001018 0xFFFFFFFF

# boot from the MBR vector table at 0x0 (real reset entry)
cpu VectorTableOffset 0x0

logLevel 3
